## User

The factorial of a natural number.

## Type

type
```lean
def fact (n : ℕ) : ℕ
```

## Term

```lean
n * fact n
```

## lean

## lean


```lean
by
  induction n with
  | zero => simp
  | succ n ih =>
    simp only [add_succ, fact_succ, ih]
    exact Nat.mul_le_mul_right _ (Nat.le_succ n)
```

